agao how to get along better. Hana decides to put the \"fear of man\" into her students, using a high-stakes game of tag.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-04-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o6STiAqcp95fLv7YCrgmoszP8Y5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o6STiAqcp95fLv7YCrgmoszP8Y5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138180/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"3631167","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tsubaki inadvertently learns the truth about why she and her fellow students are told to believe men are scary. Mokuren has a relaxing day off lined up, but that's easier said than done when there's a never-ending demand for her skills.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-05-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9MBPXIksoj3ejtV3G1EDCMRImMT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9MBPXIksoj3ejtV3G1EDCMRImMT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138180/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"3631168","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"An unusual competition results when Asagao accuses Team Horse of stealing what's rightfully hers. Ajisai's two older teammates constantly baby her, and she'll try just about anything to get them to stop.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-05-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fLakS9F91XXzndumO5suuSbQePf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLakS9F91XXzndumO5suuSbQePf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138180/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"3631169","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rindou the transfer student arrives, but she's not exactly what the girls are expecting. Having joined Team Dog due to her unusual background, Rindou's first big challenge might be winning over one of her own teammates!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-05-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nqloZVsylxQm5G3jlr7v4c6LI0Z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nqloZVsylxQm5G3jlr7v4c6LI0Z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138180/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"3631170","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rindou is slowly getting used to life in her new village, but some of the girls are in a hurry for her to take off her mask. Sazanka grows suspicious when Hana issues a late-night summons to Tsubaki and Rindou.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-05-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aezDmwB9wPpwsQesaIZ2sQxnX4y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aezDmwB9wPpwsQesaIZ2sQxnX4y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138180/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"3631171","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Team Boar is back in town, and if it weren't for a certain quirk they have in common, they would probably be unstoppable. When Rindou wonders why Sazanka calls Tsubaki \"Nee-sama,\" she gets a story about how Team Dog first came to be.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-05-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m5Gvd0E1Oy2qKh67y8VYeq5CQ2Y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m5Gvd0E1Oy2qKh67y8VYeq5CQ2Y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138180/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"3631172","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Catching snakes is sometimes easier said than done, especially when shenanigans abound. Team Rooster returns after a long sojourn in the mountains, but have they achieved the results team leader Sumire desired?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-06-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/21iDRKPlUjjUf530zof5AQeRUqj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/21iDRKPlUjjUf530zof5AQeRUqj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138180/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"3631173","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Leading a team isn't easy for Tachiaoi, especially when her members always seem to have ideas on opposite sides of a spectrum. Meanwhile, different team leaders employ all manner of their own approaches, as Benisumomo helps demonstrate.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-06-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xnqWKw6fRd2emhkQd7sbMVppPqk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xnqWKw6fRd2emhkQd7sbMVppPqk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138180/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"3631174","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Rindou introduces Tsubaki to the concept of attractiveness, it doesn't take long before word gets out. Soon, half the girls in the village are practicing what they believe is a new and easy method for defeating men.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-06-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l8sACJJlt8hYYTYhjKBGpqyNXFJ.jpg","stills":[{"type"